## 🚀 NEXT: Build Android APK

### The 3-Step Process:

```bash
# Step 1: Install Capacitor (one time only)
npm install @capacitor/core @capacitor/cli @capacitor/android

# Step 2: Sync web files to Android project
npx cap sync

# Step 3: Build APK
npx cap build android
```

### Result:
Your APK will be created at:
```
android/app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk
```

